{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16218080","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16218080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621808001:1":{"text":"好棒，我们做到了！我们把那些魔物都解决掉了！","source_cn":"好棒，我们做到了！我们把那些魔物都解决掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD153A7309C79331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621808002:1":{"text":"真相已经调查清楚，豪斯镇的危机也已经解决。这样一来，这次跑团也算圆满结束了吧？","source_cn":"真相已经调查清楚，豪斯镇的危机也已经解决。这样一来，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAA7E846B09C39BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621808003:1":{"text":"不，你们还没有解决我。","source_cn":"不，你们还没有解决我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB997079533EE95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621808004:1":{"text":"可你是——","source_cn":"可你是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x395619CE57E95BC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621808005:0":{"text":"我是恶魔，是引发魔物袭击的源头。","source_cn":"我是恶魔，是引发魔物袭击的源头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED7BB69BC4D36384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621808006:0":{"text":"别一副紧张